  => STEP 2 PASS: the feature is correctly scoped to the EGRESS interface. With
     `ip directed-broadcast` on the ingress interface the identical frames are
     still dropped, byte for byte the same stimulus that STEP 3 forwards 10/10
     with the command moved and nothing else changed. A configuration that reads
     as enabled can therefore be entirely without effect, and no `show` command
     reveals it -- recorded as an observation, because a wrong configuration of
     this kind reads as a product failure.

